OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main hits homes and
OL,4,Acloses schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThousands of properties left without
OL,7,Fwater should have it restored "shortly"
OL,8,Fas repairs are set continue around the
OL,9,Fclock.
OL,11,FAs many as 15,000 properties were left
OL,12,Fwithout water or with low pressure in
OL,13,FSurrey and London after a burst main
OL,14,Fdisrupted supply.
OL,16,FThames Water said it had rerouted water
OL,17,Faround its network for customers.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
