OL,3,GNEWSABurst water main hits homes and
OL,4,Acloses schools
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe firm apologised for the outage,
OL,7,Fadding it had "isolated" the burst main
OL,8,Fin Molesey, which hit Thames Ditton,
OL,9,FEsher, and Sunbury, other parts of
OL,10,FSurrey and south London.
